50: ## WP1 integration 0112 — public project-text preparation
51: 
52: The independently reviewed [WP1 proposal](../project-text-writing-0109.md) is integrated as a fifth task, `WP1-project-build-text`; WC1/WM1/WM2/WB1 and their synthetic controls retain their definitions. The exact [preserved review](../project-text-writing-0109/review-0110.json), SHA256 `2dc007939a4b0637716027ef6e5a874702c9be7288daf80c3f007c07f382cdaf`, supplies scoped CLEAR for this integration preparation only. The changed tree awaits separate independent review. [New provenance](integration-0112-provenance.md) and [pins](integration-0112-provenance.json) distinguish this work from historical approval.
